<p>Howdy hey!</p>
<p>I'm <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/karablue9482" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(7130109); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7130109&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608359585" alt="Karablue9482" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7130109)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/karablue9482" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(7130109); return false;">Karablue9482</a></span> and today I'll drop a little crit for ya!</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Line&nbsp;by&nbsp;line&nbsp;and&nbsp;general&nbsp;thoughts.</a></div>
